    <shortName>CTD Derived Products</shortName>
    <title>CalCOFI CTD Derived Hydrographic Products</title>
    <creator>
      <organizationName>California Cooperative Oceanic Fisheries Investigations</organizationName>
    </creator>
    <pubDate>2026-10-01</pubDate>
    <language>eng</language>
    <abstract>
      <para>Hydrographic products DERIVED from the CalCOFI CTD cast profiles rather than measured: spice (spiciness at 0 dbar, TEOS-10) and the sensor-pair averaged sigma-theta at every published CTD depth; per cast, the mixed-layer depth by three criteria, the depth and value of the chlorophyll-a maximum and the chlorophyll-a integrated over 0-200 m; and the relative geostrophic velocity between adjacent stations of each CalCOFI line, referenced to 500 dbar. Computed from the full-resolution 1 m bins of the CalCOFI CTD Cast Files after the provider's quality flags are applied.</para>
    </abstract>
